# AWS Infrastructure Management

Always clean up AWS resources to avoid unnecessary costs.

Resources to check:

- EC2 Instances
- EBS Volumes
- Elastic IPs
- Load Balancers
- Auto Scaling Groups
- Snapshots
- Security Groups (unused)

---

## Best Practices

- Stop unused instances.
- Delete unnecessary resources.
- Verify the selected AWS Region.
- Monitor AWS Billing regularly.

