# 9. File Ownership

View ownership

```bash
ls -l
```

Change owner

```bash
sudo chown amit file.txt
```

Change owner and group

```bash
sudo chown amit:devops file.txt
```

---

# 10. Linux Permissions

Permission values

| Permission | Value |
|------------|------:|
| Read | 4 |
| Write | 2 |
| Execute | 1 |

Example

```bash
chmod 755 script.sh
```

---

# 11. Umask

View current umask

```bash
umask
```

Example

```
022
```

Default permissions

```
Files

666 - 022 = 644

Directories

777 - 022 = 755
```

---

# 12. Archive Management

## Create Archive

```bash
tar -cvzf backup.tar.gz folder/
```

Options

- c → Create
- v → Verbose
- z → Compress (gzip)
- f → File

---

## Extract Archive

```bash
tar -xvzf backup.tar.gz
```

---

# 13. Stream Editor (sed)

Replace text

```bash
sed 's/dev/prod/g' file.txt
```

Save changes

```bash
sed -i 's/dev/prod/g' file.txt
```

---

# 14. Service Management

Restart SSH

```bash
sudo systemctl restart sshd
```

Status

```bash
systemctl status sshd
```

Enable on Boot

```bash
systemctl enable sshd
```

